<title>SOUTH AFRICA: C.G. Smith weighing Romatex stake.</title>
<headline>C.G. Smith weighing Romatex stake.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>C.G. Smith Ltd said on Monday it was engaged in discussions regarding its stake in clothing and textile group Romatex Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;Should a transaction be successfully concluded this may have an impact on Romatex's share price. However, it is not expected to have an impact on the share price of C.G. Smith,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>C.G. Smith holds 60 percenmt of Romatex.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
